oting nearly 100 million people  have voted already  um so what does that tell you about this  state of the race  to me that that says people are engaged  they are involved what does it say to  you with with your veteran eye  on how elections and turnout  and what they say about the state of the  country itself  well first of all i want to see what the  turnout is tomorrow  on the final day of voting but another  thing that makes this camp  this presidential campaign unique is the  amount  of votes count cast  before the final vote day there's never  anything even  close to this nothing approaching it and  i would say my careful analysis not just  to my own one reason  one reason that we've had such a heavy  a pre-vote voting before the final  voting day  is because women have really turned out  in very strong numbers now there are a  lot of democrats who think well that's  good news for them  well we'll have to see when the votes  are counted but  something like 55 50 57  of the votes already in came from women  also the youth vote young people  really turned out so far now it may turn  out in the final analysis  that they don't go to go to the polls  tomorrow that they've already sent in  their votes so they don't go  but women and young voters are carrying  the democrats and if joe biden wins  it will be because he got uh so many  women going his way and so many  young people if donald trump wins it  will be because he held his base  and he sucked away he got away enough of  the african-american vote particularly  african-american men  and the uh latinx or hispanic vote  particularly  then he got enough of them to go his way  to put together his base to win i think  that's where we are if you had to bet it  and i recommend strongly you don't bet  uh  if you had to bet it you would say to  yourself well the importance look good  for joe biden  but you know overnight's a long time in  politics  a week is forever it may take a week to  decide this so i would  encourage no one jumping to any  conclusion i consider to be a very fluid  race  i do think that donald trump can win  there's at least  one clear path by which you can win if  he takes florida  and pennsylvania and managed to hold  both he can win  uh but coming down to it all the early  signs  point to abiding victory but that  doesn't mean that's going to be the  final outcome  that is all really important information  and a reality check for i think everyone  at home  dan rather thank you so much for sharing  your wisdom and your expertise and for  joining  stay safe out there we'll be watching  the results alongside  so many like you who have lived through  this many cycles  or many presidential campaigns and cycle  after cycle

